    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/d1338c826860983b2e0e500196b4f005.avif?t=1753711192\" /></span>In </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the dawn of time, a singular entity, the Primordial Creator, existed before the sun shone or the mountains rose. Trapped in the solitude of its omnipotence, it chose to shatter itself into countless facets, giving birth to the gods. Some, drawn to order, aligned with the Light, while others, tempted by chaos, embraced the Darkness. Seeking transcendence, these gods created races in their own image, sparking titanic wars between Light and Darkness that shook the very foundations of the cosmos. Over time, these wars faded into memory, giving way to a fragile peace that endured for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/2b4052548ec76939763270fd2d072c65.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/2b4052548ec76939763270fd2d072c65.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/2b4052548ec76939763270fd2d072c65.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a dark rumor has begun to spread: the return of the Dark Lord, the last leader of Darkness, whose fate remains shrouded in mystery (was he destroyed, exiled, or imprisoned?). In Secret Forest, the balance is faltering. Ancient alliances are crumbling, and tensions among races are reigniting. Rebel factions arise within each side, driven by old grudges and new ambitions. Peace hangs by a thread, and the world stands on the brink of a new age of conflict, where once again, the fate of Light and Darkness will be decided on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e34b09d29fed7a68e1e743b2b4fe6d1d.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e34b09d29fed7a68e1e743b2b4fe6d1d.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e34b09d29fed7a68e1e743b2b4fe6d1d.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECISIONS THAT SHAPE DESTINY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice between Light and Darkness will not only influence the enemies you face but also how you interact with the world and its inhabitants. The allies you make, the secrets you uncover, and the decisions you take will determine the outcome of your adventure and the future of the Secret Forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to decide the fate of <i>Secret Forest</i>? Choose your side, accept the challenge, and write your own story in this world filled with magic, conflict, and infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/b5b6614550832c9392e1e0784ff1581e.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/b5b6614550832c9392e1e0784ff1581e.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/b5b6614550832c9392e1e0784ff1581e.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE MECHANICS IN STUNNING MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a collection of incredible islands, full of secrets waiting to be discovered. Explore, collect unique items, and overcome challenges with friends in a dynamic environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In certain areas, the game will balance players' levels to ensure a fair and challenging experience. Here, strategy will be key to survival and success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/a3b4f7d2b634193d989dd14e504cacfd.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/a3b4f7d2b634193d989dd14e504cacfd.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/a3b4f7d2b634193d989dd14e504cacfd.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIMITLESS CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero, your story, your style. <i>Secret Forest</i> allows you to design unique characters, craft epic armor, and ride majestic creatures that reflect your essence. Every detail matters, and no hero will be like another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/5abe803f71a9fa5b7fc4638f1fa2ea44.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/5abe803f71a9fa5b7fc4638f1fa2ea44.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/5abe803f71a9fa5b7fc4638f1fa2ea44.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/f619153f13ddfa57cdfa4144d3693183.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/f619153f13ddfa57cdfa4144d3693183.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/f619153f13ddfa57cdfa4144d3693183.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC MISSIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is more than just a simple objective; they are challenges filled with tactics, ingenuity, and excitement. In <i>Secret Forest</i>, success depends not only on your strength but also on your ability to plan, adapt, and make smart decisions in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/aa608a18f6b032b9ead5b3ce41169f41.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/aa608a18f6b032b9ead5b3ce41169f41.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/aa608a18f6b032b9ead5b3ce41169f41.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC AND STRATEGIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a flexible combat system packed with possibilities. Choose from different classes and specializations, combine melee attacks with ranged abilities, and create unique strategies to face any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/493e9d4ce37189853c5764cba10bb41b.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/493e9d4ce37189853c5764cba10bb41b.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/493e9d4ce37189853c5764cba10bb41b.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIVE YOUR ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From engaging in epic battles to enjoying the calm of fishing, the forest offers endless possibilities. Develop magical skills, master the art of survival, or simply explore the natural beauty around you. In <i>Secret Forest</i>, you write your own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/697bd438e8203843f40320a1d0a3256b.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/697bd438e8203843f40320a1d0a3256b.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/697bd438e8203843f40320a1d0a3256b.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONSTANT SUPPORT AND FREQUENT UPDATES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our commitment doesn't end at launch. <i>Secret Forest</i> will constantly evolve with regular updates, improvements, and new features to keep the game fresh and exciting for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e6e6f30717e1b69cdb3f4109cc7928ee.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e6e6f30717e1b69cdb3f4109cc7928ee.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e6e6f30717e1b69cdb3f4109cc7928ee.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/d1338c826860983b2e0e500196b4f005.avif?t=1753711192\" /></span>In </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the dawn of time, a singular entity, the Primordial Creator, existed before the sun shone or the mountains rose. Trapped in the solitude of its omnipotence, it chose to shatter itself into countless facets, giving birth to the gods. Some, drawn to order, aligned with the Light, while others, tempted by chaos, embraced the Darkness. Seeking transcendence, these gods created races in their own image, sparking titanic wars between Light and Darkness that shook the very foundations of the cosmos. Over time, these wars faded into memory, giving way to a fragile peace that endured for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/2b4052548ec76939763270fd2d072c65.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/2b4052548ec76939763270fd2d072c65.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/2b4052548ec76939763270fd2d072c65.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a dark rumor has begun to spread: the return of the Dark Lord, the last leader of Darkness, whose fate remains shrouded in mystery (was he destroyed, exiled, or imprisoned?). In Secret Forest, the balance is faltering. Ancient alliances are crumbling, and tensions among races are reigniting. Rebel factions arise within each side, driven by old grudges and new ambitions. Peace hangs by a thread, and the world stands on the brink of a new age of conflict, where once again, the fate of Light and Darkness will be decided on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e34b09d29fed7a68e1e743b2b4fe6d1d.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e34b09d29fed7a68e1e743b2b4fe6d1d.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e34b09d29fed7a68e1e743b2b4fe6d1d.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECISIONS THAT SHAPE DESTINY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice between Light and Darkness will not only influence the enemies you face but also how you interact with the world and its inhabitants. The allies you make, the secrets you uncover, and the decisions you take will determine the outcome of your adventure and the future of the Secret Forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to decide the fate of <i>Secret Forest</i>? Choose your side, accept the challenge, and write your own story in this world filled with magic, conflict, and infinite possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/b5b6614550832c9392e1e0784ff1581e.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/b5b6614550832c9392e1e0784ff1581e.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/b5b6614550832c9392e1e0784ff1581e.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNIQUE MECHANICS IN STUNNING MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a collection of incredible islands, full of secrets waiting to be discovered. Explore, collect unique items, and overcome challenges with friends in a dynamic environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In certain areas, the game will balance players' levels to ensure a fair and challenging experience. Here, strategy will be key to survival and success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/a3b4f7d2b634193d989dd14e504cacfd.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/a3b4f7d2b634193d989dd14e504cacfd.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/a3b4f7d2b634193d989dd14e504cacfd.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIMITLESS CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hero, your story, your style. <i>Secret Forest</i> allows you to design unique characters, craft epic armor, and ride majestic creatures that reflect your essence. Every detail matters, and no hero will be like another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/5abe803f71a9fa5b7fc4638f1fa2ea44.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/5abe803f71a9fa5b7fc4638f1fa2ea44.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/5abe803f71a9fa5b7fc4638f1fa2ea44.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/f619153f13ddfa57cdfa4144d3693183.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/f619153f13ddfa57cdfa4144d3693183.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/f619153f13ddfa57cdfa4144d3693183.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC MISSIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is more than just a simple objective; they are challenges filled with tactics, ingenuity, and excitement. In <i>Secret Forest</i>, success depends not only on your strength but also on your ability to plan, adapt, and make smart decisions in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/aa608a18f6b032b9ead5b3ce41169f41.poster.avif?t=1753711192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/aa608a18f6b032b9ead5b3ce41169f41.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/aa608a18f6b032b9ead5b3ce41169f41.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC AND STRATEGIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a flexible combat system packed with possibilities. Choose from different classes and specializations, combine melee attacks with ranged abilities, and create unique strategies to face any situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http