1192\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e6e6f30717e1b69cdb3f4109cc7928ee.webm?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508550/extras/e6e6f30717e1b69cdb3f4109cc7928ee.mp4?t=1753711192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
